1
00:00:00,901 --> 00:00:03,991
(Bernadette:)We decided to go down to city hall
this afternoon, get married...

2
00:00:04,196 --> 00:00:06,696
(Bernadette:)...and then have the reception
when Howard gets back.

3
00:00:06,907 --> 00:00:08,117
- That's so great.
- Cool.

4
00:00:08,325 --> 00:00:11,415
(Howard:)We know it's short notice,
but we'd love you all to come with us.

5
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:15,120
(Amy:)No, no, no,
this is not the wedding I wanted.

6
00:00:16,875 --> 00:00:18,625
l wanna wear
my maid-of-honor dress...

7
00:00:18,836 --> 00:00:21,256
(Amy:)...walk down the aisle
with a hundred eyes on me...

8
00:00:21,463 --> 00:00:24,633
(Amy:)...while a string quartet plays
"The way You Look Tonight."

9
00:00:24,967 --> 00:00:26,597
That wasn't our processional music.

10
00:00:26,802 --> 00:00:28,632
Well, it was gonna be mine.

11
00:00:29,388 --> 00:00:32,268
(Sheldon:)Thank you for the invitation,
but I have to decline...

12
00:00:32,474 --> 00:00:35,064
(Sheldon:)...because it doesn't sound like
something I'll enjoy.

13
00:00:36,645 --> 00:00:37,975
Come on, it'll be fun.

14
00:00:38,397 --> 00:00:40,987
(Sheldon:)That's what you said about
the Green Lantern movie.

15
00:00:42,734 --> 00:00:45,364
(Sheldon:)You were 114 minutes of wrong.

16
00:00:46,488 --> 00:00:48,408
(Bernadette:)So, what do you say, Amy?

17
00:00:50,325 --> 00:00:54,075
- Can I wear my maid-of-honor dress?
- Seriously? Wear that thing to city hall?

18
00:00:54,288 --> 00:01:05,028
(Amy:)It's all I have left.
You gonna take that from me too?

